'''THE DYNAMITES''' (超激ダイナマイツ chō geki dainamaitsu, ''Lit. '''Super Super Dynamites''''') is the first [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] unlocked in [[The Battle Cats POP!]] A feature unique with the Nintendo 3DS version is that [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare]] and [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Units]] are unlocked over time thus expanding the regular pool of the game. To unlock this banner, it requires beating [[Saudi Arabia (Empire of Cats)|Saudi Arabia]] from Chapter 1.

